  "findings": [
    "The new loader requires the exact accepted native configuration, preparation, independent model cold and both successful external owners, with source pins and the separate root receipt. It binds the actual raw model identity, declares the 23010-row replacement, and checks the recorded complete parent restoration; it does not incorrectly treat the whole original model as an unchanged byte prefix.",
    "The independent indexed arithmetic retains every original and added variable domain and linear row, uses Python integers throughout, rejects bool/float values, and handles signed coefficients, empty rows and disconnected domains. Thirteen complete function texts, including the row checker, runtime/parameter checker and supervisor predicate, are unchanged.",
    "The complete response parsed from original native UTF-8 text must equal the separately reconstructed wire message. Native primary and every additional solution snapshot must match all protobuf vector fields exactly. Candidate file identities, ordering, complete domain/row checks and every saved canonical activity byte are verified; no first-candidate-only acceptance exists.",
    "The exact four-worker parameter message is checked against both text and wire representations, descriptor hashes and pinned runtime files. One600-second solver clock,610-second measured native allowance and720-second owner are explicit. Accepted preflight has zero calls, a75-second successful owner and the same actual model and parameters.",
    "Native overrun remains UNKNOWN_NATIVE_BUDGET_OVERRUN; INFEASIBLE remains UNPROVED_NATIVE_INFEASIBLE. A positive vector is a witness only for the stated combined relaxation. Original pair-cap completeness, second-component completion and a whole graph are not inferred.",
    "The checker imports protobuf decoders and package metadata only, with explicit absence assertions for CpModel/native solver modules. Its main includes report serialization in the120-second phase bound. A report saved just before a late failure remains unaccepted unless the separate135-second owner observes successful exit, reaping and stopped process group.",
    "The zero-call budget branch requires no returned vectors or response/candidate files. Partial, timeout and owner-failure records are preserved by the surrounding unchanged ownership contract and cannot receive the successful terminal acceptance.",
    "The frozen production driver22d20e4a and checker CLI/status/report fields match: independent controls under15 seconds and main under135 seconds; source/config/gate/result/owner hashes are mandatory."
  ],
